#if(v_agility >= 2 && v_strength >= 1 && v_b2_ch5_scimitar != 0) {
 

The gladiator closes the distance and plants his boots a dozen feet away, sizing me up with a smug, heavy grin. He says nothing. The arrogance in his stance says everything—he sees an easy slaughter.

The horn sounds. The man lunges forward, hoisting the heavy battleaxe high for an overhead cleave.

Closing straight into an incoming charge is risky, but changing course now is fatal. I burst forward, cutting inside his arc with sudden, explosive speed.

My acceleration catches him off guard. I hook the curved tip of Velgos's scimitar over the axe head, plant my heels, and wrench backward with full force. The weapon rips cleanly from his grip, spinning away into the sand.

I surge into his guard. The gladiator scrambles backward in panic, catches his heel in the dirt, and crashes onto his back. Before he can draw a breath, the cold steel of my scimitar is pressed against his throat.

}
#if(v_b2_ch5_scimitar == 0 && v_agility >= 2 && v_strength >= 2) {
 

The gladiator closes the distance and plants his boots a dozen feet away, sizing me up with a smug, heavy grin. He says nothing. The arrogance in his stance says everything—he sees an easy slaughter.

