Closing straight into an incoming charge is risky, but changing course now is fatal. I burst forward, cutting inside his arc with sudden, explosive speed.

My acceleration catches him off guard. I drive my enchanted dagger in a vicious upward sweep against the ash-wood haft of his axe, putting every ounce of boosted muscle behind the strike. The impact shatters his grip, sending the heavy axe flying.

I surge into his guard. The gladiator scrambles backward in panic, catches his heel in the dirt, and crashes onto his back. Before he can draw a breath, the cold tip of my dagger rests against his throat.

}
