I dance around his heavy swings until his breathing turns ragged. The moment he overreaches, my trained footwork carries me inside his guard. I sink my dagger into his left flank beneath the armor. He recoils with a roar of panic, stumbles backward, and hits the sand hard, dropping the axe. I boot the weapon aside and pin the dagger blade against his windpipe.

}
